Scenario: Add Blogs Entry With Inline Image Via URL
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Add Entry
	And BlogsEntry add Title
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsEntry add Content
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
	And ItemSelector goto Item Selector Via Alloy Editor
	And ItemSelector add From URL
		|imageSourceURL|https://dummyimage.com/600x400/000/fff.jpg|
	And Pause at locator '1000'
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry CP
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsEntry view Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	Then BlogsEntry view Inline Image
		|uploadFileName|https://dummyimage.com/600x400/000/fff.jpg|
