Scenario: CK Editor Smoke
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|editor.wysiwyg.portal-web.docroot.html.portlet.blogs.edit_entry.jsp=ckeditor|
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Add Entry
	And AlloyEditor add Title
		|title|CKEditor Entry Title|
	And CKEditor assert Editor Present
	And CKEditor add Content
		|content|CKEditor Entry Content|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry CP
		|entryTitle|CKEditor Entry Title|
	And BlogsEntry view Title
		|entryTitle|CKEditor Entry Title|
	And SelectFrame at locator 'CKEditor#BODY_FIELD_IFRAME'
	Then CKEditor view Entry Content
		|content|CKEditor Entry Content|
