Scenario: View Error Message For Null Custom Abstract
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Add Entry
	And Panel expand Panel
		|panelHeading|Configuration|
	And Click at locator 'Radio#CUSTOM_ABSTRACT'
	And AssertClick assert Text Click At the value 'Publish' at locator 'Button#PUBLISH'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'This field is required to publish the entry.' at locator 'BlogsEntry#TITLE_FIELD_HELPER'
	Then AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'This field is required.' at locator 'BlogsEntry#CONTENT_FIELD_HELPER'